## Current Architecture

```
User uploads photo → API route → parseImageWithGeminiVision()
  ├── Tier 1: Gemini 2.0 Flash (direct API)
  ├── Tier 2: Groq (Llama 3.3 70B) ← Quality Check
  └── Tier 3: OpenRouter (Gemini Flash / Claude 3.5 / Gemma 27B)
       ↓
  parseJsonSafely() → handles [...] or {medicines: [...]}
       ↓
  normalizeMedicines() → normalizePacking() + normalizeExpiryDate()
       ↓
  dedup() → merge duplicate rows, sum quantities
       ↓
  Review UI (98vw full-screen) → User validates → bulk-import API
       ↓
  Upsert Medicine Master + Create Inventory Batches
```
